# WP-056 golden: Pyre Breath is a channel: holding LIGHT breathes Fire every 10 ticks until it is released (record with `lf-tools replay record-script`). Each line:
# <ticks> <move_x> <move_z> [BUTTONS], plus `cmd` lines. The player rests at the Lantern and
# raises Devotion by 20 (every Litany's requirement is at most 20), then attunes Pyre Breath and holds LIGHT for a second and a half, then lets go. The reliquary
# and the Litanies come from the `litany_range` scenario.
seed 5623
scenario litany_range
10 0 0            # settle on the ground
cmd Rest
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd LevelUp 6
cmd Equip 32 15023     # attune Pyre Breath
2 0 0
60 0 0 LIGHT        # hold: six breaths at dummy_front
30 0 0                 # let go: the channel ends
